abel pi-secondary-font\">Value</h3>\n<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\">18,000 - 25,000 gp</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"npcvalue\">\n<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Sold for</h3>\n<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\">18,000 gp</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"npcprice\">\n<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Bought for</h3>\n<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\">(not sold by NPCs)</div>\n</div>\n</section>\n<section class=\"pi-item pi-group pi-border-color\">\n<h2 class=\"pi-item pi-header pi-secondary-font pi-item-spacing pi-secondary-background\">Field Properties</h2>\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"walkable\">\n<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Blocking</h3>\n<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\"><span class=\"no-cross\" title=\"No\">✗</span></div>\n</div>\n</section>\n<section class=\"pi-item pi-group pi-border-color\">\n<h2 class=\"pi-item pi-header pi-secondary-font pi-item-spacing pi-secondary-background\">Other Properties</h2>\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"implemented\">\n<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Version</h3>\n<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\">8.20<br/><span class=\"implementation-date\">July 2, 2008<br/>Summer Update 2008</span></div>\n</div>\n</section>\n<nav class=\"pi-navigation pi-item-spacing pi-secondary-font\">See also: Objects<span class=\"explained\">Help</span></nav>\n</aside>\n<div id=\"w-twbox-intro\">\n<div id=\"w-object-profile\">\n<div id=\"w-twbox-image\"><img alt=\"latest?cb=20171030111821&amp;path-prefix=en&amp;format=original\" class=\"\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/wiki/Skullcracker_Armor_c8614f.gif\"/></div>\n<div id=\"w-twbox-look\"><div class=\"item-look tibiatext tibiagreen\">You see a skullcracker armor <span class=\"p-attributes\">(Arm:14, protection death +5%, holy -5%)</span>.<br/>Classification: 2 Tier: 0.<div class=\"p-reqs\">It can only be wielded properly by knights of level 85 or higher.<br/></div><div class=\"p-weight\">It weighs 110.00 oz.</div><br/></div></div>\n<div class=\"\" id=\"w-twbox-sounds\"><span class=\"tibiatext tibiaorange\"><ul class=\"sound-list\"></ul></span></div>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div style=\"clear:left;\"></div>\n<div id=\"w-object-notes\">\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"w-Notes\">Notes</span></h3>\n<p>It gives 5% death protection, but increases damage taken from holy by 5%. Compare with <a href=\"#/wiki/Yalahari%20Armor\">Yalahari Armor</a>, which gives 2% less resistance to death for 2 more armor. In most cases against death-damaging creatures, this armor will reduce more damage than <a href=\"#/wiki/Yalahari%20Armor\">Yalahari Armor</a>.\n</p>\n</div>\n<p><br/>\n</p>\n<div style=\"clear:left;\"></div>\n<div id=\"w-item-droppedby\">\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"w-Dropped_By\">Dropped By</span></h3>\n<div class=\"item-droppedby-wrapper\">\n<ul><li><a href=\"#/wiki/Annihilon\">Annihilon</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"#/wiki/Bony%20Sea%20Devil\">Bony Sea Devil</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"#/wiki/Feroxa\">Feroxa</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"#/wiki/Frost%20Flower%20Asura\">Frost Flower Asura</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"#/wiki/Grim%20Reaper\">Grim Reaper</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"#/wiki/Haunted%20Dragon\">Haunted Dragon</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"#/wiki/Midnight%20Asura\">Midnight Asura</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"#/wiki/The%20Moonlight%20Aster\">The Moonlight Aster</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"#/wiki/The%20Scourge%20of%20Oblivion\">The Scourge of Oblivion</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"#/wiki/True%20Frost%20Flower%20Asura\">True Frost Flower Asura</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"#/wiki/True%20Midnight%20Asura\">True Midnight Asura</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"#/wiki/Undead%20Dragon\">Undead Dragon</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"#/wiki/Winged%20Jaracal\">Winged Jaracal</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"#/wiki/Zavarash\">Zavarash</a></li></ul>\n<div sty